added_comments.text:
// Each line is rounded on its own, while the invoice totals are rounded once
// over the whole order, so the two can drift by up to half a minor unit per
// line. Add an adjustment line carrying the full difference so the lines
// always add up to the invoice total.

// Idempotency: an event (e.g. a webhook retry carrying the same idempotencyKey) is
// notified at most once, no matter how far apart the deliveries are. Distinct events for
// the same user/type are never suppressed.
